{"agent":"lane-sec-policy-contact","data":{"budget":"","claim":"A knob [export].security_contact, rendered in a named reporting region, fills the section; the default export redaction would mask an email contact unless that string is exempted.","dedupe":{"answer":"new","candidates":[],"score":null},"falsifier":"A configured contact appears verbatim in the rendered SECURITY.md with default redaction and no change to redact_text.","item":"SEC-policy-contact","mechanism":"The Reporting section was template text outside the regions, written once; redact_text runs over the rendered body and the email pattern replaces any address.","probe":"python3 -I -c 'redact_text(\"Mail [REDACTED:email] now\")' on the unfixed code","probe_output":"Mail [REDACTED:email] now","question":"Can the security export carry a configured reporting contact, and does export redaction mask an email contact?","sources":[],"verdict":"CONFIRMED"},"id":"e565e466a95bd48595df4557e","kind":"research.recorded","lamport":195674,"schema":1,"subject":"R-sec-policy-contact","ts":"2026-11-13T18:56:36.080595Z"}
